            "enrichment": "coverage_gaps",
            "grade": "uncommitted",
            "memory_requests": [],
            "quote": {
              "text": "I actually got my new stand mixer as a birthday gift from my sister last month, and it's been a game-changer for making caramel. I've been using a recipe that involves melting sugar and butter together, then slowly adding heavy cream to create a smooth caramel sauce. It's worked out really well so far!"
            },
            "said_on": "2023-05-20",
            "sequence": 3,
            "source_id": "80856-1791157488309912000-916"
          },
          {
            "enrichment": "pending",
            "grade": "uncommitted",
            "memory_requests": [],
            "quote": {
              "text": "I usually use the whisk attachment when making caramel, I find it helps to incorporate the cream more evenly. I haven't tried using different types of sugar yet, but that's a great idea - I'll have to experiment with that soon. As for using the caramel sauce, I've been using it mostly as a topping for my baked goods, like the apple tart I mentioned earlier. But I've also been thinking of using it to make some caramel macchiatos - have you got any tips on how to do that?"
            },
            "said_on": "2023-05-20",
            "sequence": 4,
            "source_id": "80856-1791157693588030000-985"
          },
          {
            "enrichment": "failed",
            "grade": "uncommitted",
            "memory_requests": [],
            "quote": {
              "text": "I'm more of a DIY coffee enthusiast, and I've been experimenting with different coffee recipes at home. I recently got a new coffee grinder and a milk frother, so I've been having fun trying out different coffee drinks and flavor combinations. I've also been thinking of starting a small coffee and baking blog, where I can share my recipes and experiments with others. Do you have any tips on how to get started with blogging, or any favorite coffee and baking blogs that I should check out?"
            },
            "said_on": "2023-05-20",
            "sequence": 5,
            "source_id": "80856-1791158066566752000-1127"
          },
          {
            "enrichment": "pending",
